1
00:00:00,227 --> 00:00:02,767
(Leonard:)We think we can help you
with your stage fright.

2
00:00:02,938 --> 00:00:04,728
(Sheldon:)Oh, I doubt that.

3
00:00:04,899 --> 00:00:08,439
(Sheldon:)I haven't figured out a way
and I'm much smarter than all of you.

4
00:00:10,654 --> 00:00:13,784
(Penny:)Yes, but you're not smarter
than all of us put together.

5
00:00:13,949 --> 00:00:16,119
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm sorry.
That is what I meant.

6
00:00:17,161 --> 00:00:20,661
(Penny:)Okay. Your problem is
you're trying to do this all by yourself.

7
00:00:20,873 --> 00:00:22,793
We could help you.
We can be your team.

8
00:00:22,958 --> 00:00:25,378
Like Professor Xavier
and his X-Men.

9
00:00:29,799 --> 00:00:31,879
(Sheldon:)I do like the X-Men.

10
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:34,140
(Penny:)Did I see X-Men?

11
00:00:34,303 --> 00:00:36,803
(Leonard:)Yeah, we watched it last week.
You said you liked it.

12
00:00:36,972 --> 00:00:38,972
(Penny:)Oh, I say a lot of things, sweetie.

13
00:00:40,184 --> 00:00:42,434
(Penny:)So how about it, Sheldon?

14
00:00:42,603 --> 00:00:47,443
(Sheldon:)I don't know. If you're my X-Men,
what are your powers?

15
00:00:47,608 --> 00:00:50,858
Okay, well, I'm gonna take you
shopping, get you a nice suit.

16
00:00:51,028 --> 00:00:54,028
(Penny:)-Might give you more confidence.
-It's not exactly a mutation...

17
00:00:54,198 --> 00:00:57,448
(Sheldon:)...that would get you into Xavier's
School for Gifted Youngsters...

18
00:00:57,618 --> 00:00:59,118
(Sheldon:)...but go on. Leonard?

